	(text "Notes\n- Module antenna end at the board edge: no copper, no vias in the antenna strip.\n- EN: 10k + 1u gives the reset delay; RESET pulls it low. BOOT = IO0 (strapping), 10k pull-up, button to GND.\n- UART0 pads TXD0/RXD0 + GND + 3V3 + EN + IO0 are the programming header (ESP auto-program order).\n- GPIO map matches firmware Kconfig DESK_BOARD_NOTIFIER_V1 (checked by hardware/tools/checks.py).\n- USB D+/D- (IO20/IO19) come from the Power sheet: 90 ohm pair, keep short. Unused pins carry no-connect flags." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a31d6705-6a58-53ba-a3f9-ae0aeda3d6f2"))
